>
	<p>
		I'm a full-stack engineer and Lead Forward Deployed Engineer with a career spanning over a decade of delivering enterprise-scale applications and, more recently, leading end-to-end delivery of AI-powered products and solutions. I work closely with clients from discovery to production, focusing on AI integration, full-stack engineering, client consulting, and project ownership within a consulting environment — turning complex business challenges into robust, production-ready systems.
	</p>

	<p>
		My core expertise lies in full-stack development and enterprise software architecture, combined with deep, hands-on experience in modern agentic AI frameworks. I design and implement complete AI application architectures — from data ingestion through to intelligent, autonomous agent orchestration — using frameworks such as LangGraph, CrewAI, and Llama Index. I have extensive experience building Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems and large-scale predictive modeling pipelines that power real-world decision-making in enterprise environments.
	</p>

	<p>
		On the backend, I specialise in building secure, production-grade REST APIs that meet the rigorous standards of enterprise security and compliance. I bring hands-on experience across major cloud platforms — AWS, Azure, and GCP — as well as on-premise deployment environments, with a consistent focus on enterprise architecture patterns, infrastructure security, and long-term scalability. Whether migrating workloads to the cloud or designing hybrid architectures, I ensure that security and resilience are foundational, not afterthoughts.
	</p>

	<p>
		A significant part of my current work involves overseeing the deployment of advanced AI applications, including Agentic AI systems and complex GenAI/RAG solutions, into production. This means bridging the gap between research-grade models and the reliability, observability, and security expectations of enterprise operations — managing everything from model lifecycle and prompt engineering to monitoring and continuous improvement.
	</p>

	<p>
		Beyond the technical depth, I am known for translating strategic AI vision into actionable engineering roadmaps, mentoring cross-functional teams, and leading delivery across complex, multi-stakeholder programmes. I bring strong communication skills, an entrepreneurial drive, and a track record of building collaborative, high-performing engineering cultures.
	</p>
